      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-16T21:04:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we should willynilly use the other metrics as \"backup\". I haven\u0027t done research into the various modes but returning 0s feels safer than returning \"wrong\" measures.\n\nWhat do our other font backends do if they fail to get metrics?",
      "parentUuid": "20cbb832_23c7ea48",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1864,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 1864,
        "endChar": 43
      },
      "revId": "253701c3a9a7eb403e04641ed47097f77cb74ea8",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "780f5384_13c6c06b",
        "filename": "src/ports/SkScalerContext_win_dw.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 5
